TL DR;
Just no. It's an exoskeleton, has no real structure to sustain it. It tries to immitate Smash but limits the actual technicality of the game, making it a baby version of smash. All heavies are reskins and all weapons share the same light attacks. Cosmetics are just unreasonably expensive. Just download an emulation of a Smash game or get Super Smash Flash 2 if you're broke. Just don't try it.
There are so many things wrong with this game. Either its scarce content will force you to drop it or its toxic community of backlashing ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥s will force you to quit the game. Each new character comes with a reskin of "heavies" that are apperently "different". Everyone who shares the same weapon type, such as swords or pistols, will use the same light attacks and have no real individuality. Sadly, hit detection is also not very accurate as I've actually witnessed many times where the animation would actually hit the opponent but the attack would not hit the enemies hit box. The stats each character partains are not true to the in-match stats at all. To make it all worse, they removed invincibility frames while dodging and added a knock off Wave Dash which really limits reading and creates a game in which all you really see is two ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ sliding back and forth. The Weapons are unbalanced and the counterplay is very unreal when it comes to specific weapon types, specially now. Lance is now pure cancer due to the removal of dash invincibility frames, allowing complete spam to obliterate you. Light attacks on each weapon type is passed along all the characters making strings bland. Every string you make must be pure muscle memory, well if you really want to win. It seems improvisation really doesn't award you, so playing like Smash God Mang0 really punishes you.  Every attack knocks an enemy unreasonably far, making it impossible to create amazing strings. And do not get me started with the cosmetics. Over all, just buy Rivals of Aether. Closest clone you will find and just for fifteen bucks. And if you're broke, just download an emulation of a Smash game or Super Smash Flash 2. They just added an online feature on to Super smash Flash 2 which is not too shaby. Anything beats this trash.

