Horrible... configuration crashes, some in-game options doesn't work, etc.
I got this title free and I still interested in this game, but is almost unplayable....
- The buttons on the top-bar (in game) only works when you are in a game (new game by both options);
- The game appers to be set in "real-time". Anyway, I don't waited much, but maybe some thing (action?) would happen;
- The multiplayer is bugged for me, crashing the game;
- There is no way to set resolution in-game, so if the configuration doesn't open for you, I think you can't change (alt + enter also doesn't work).
I guess this sould work only in old machines/Windows.
Update: I've opened the game again because steam demands a little time for write a review. I'm understanding the game, but I'll uninstall anyway... If you knows how to set the things up and make the game work (with a multiplayer), comment here and maybe I'll install again :v

